---
// The guards in createTodo, in code order, and where each failure exits.
const W = 900;
const H = 262;
const stages = [
  { id: 'MaxBytesReader', en: 'caps the body at 1 MiB', vi: 'giới hạn body 1 MiB' },
  { id: 'DisallowUnknownFields', en: 'JSON with known keys', vi: 'JSON, chỉ key đã biết' },
  { id: 'title check', en: 'title is 1 to 100 bytes', vi: 'title dài 1 đến 100 byte' },
  { id: 'store.add', en: 'save the todo', vi: 'lưu todo' },
];
const bx = [20, 250, 480, 710];
const bw = 170;
function head(x: number, y: number, dir: 'r' | 'd') {
  return dir === 'r' ? `${x},${y} ${x - 9},${y - 5} ${x - 9},${y + 5}` : `${x},${y} ${x - 5},${y - 9} ${x + 5},${y - 9}`;
}
---
<figure class="gp10d">
  <div class="gp10d-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="A POST body passes MaxBytesReader, Decode with DisallowUnknownFields, and the title check. The first two failures give 400, the title check gives 422, and success gives 201.">
    <text x="20" y="24" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Checks in createTodo, in order</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Các bước kiểm tra trong createTodo, theo thứ tự</tspan>
    </text>
    {stages.map((s, i) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={bx[i]} y="46" width={bw} height="60" rx="8" class="box" />
        <text x={bx[i] + bw / 2} y="72" text-anchor="middle" class="b">{s.id}</text>
        <text x={bx[i] + bw / 2} y="93" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>{s.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{s.vi}</tspan></text>
        {i < 3 && (
          <g>
            <line x1={bx[i] + bw} x2={bx[i + 1] - 9} y1="76" y2="76" class="ln" />
            <polygon points={head(bx[i + 1], 76, 'r')} class="bar" />
          </g>
        )}
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x={bx[3] + bw / 2} y="132" text-anchor="middle" class="b">201 Created</text>
    <line x1={bx[3] + bw / 2} x2={bx[3] + bw / 2} y1="106" y2="114" class="ln" />

    {[0, 1, 2].map((i) => (
      <g>
        <line x1={bx[i] + 50} x2={bx[i] + 50} y1="106" y2={i === 2 ? 190 - 9 : 160 - 9} class="ln red" />
        <polygon points={head(bx[i] + 50, i === 2 ? 190 : 160, 'd')} class="hd red" style="fill: var(--red)" />
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x={bx[0] + 62} y="134" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>over 1 MiB</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>quá 1 MiB</tspan></text>
    <text x={bx[1] + 62} y="134" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>bad JSON, unknown key</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>JSON sai, key lạ</tspan></text>
    <text x={bx[2] + 62} y="134" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>empty or over 100 bytes</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>rỗng hoặc quá 100 byte</tspan></text>

    <rect x="20" y="160" width="400" height="40" rx="8" class="bad" />
    <text x="220" y="186" text-anchor="middle" class="r">400 Bad Request</text>
    <rect x="455" y="190" width="220" height="40" rx="8" class="bad" />
    <text x="565" y="216" text-anchor="middle" class="r">422 Unprocessable Entity</text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The first two guards fail while reading the body, so they share <code>400</code>: the client sent something we cannot read. The title check runs on a body we did read, so it gets <code>422</code>. Every failure answers with <code>{"{"}"error": "..."{"}"}</code>.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Hai bước đầu hỏng lúc đọc body nên dùng chung <code>400</code>: client gửi thứ ta không đọc được. Bước kiểm tra title chạy trên body đã đọc được, nên nhận <code>422</code>. Mọi lỗi đều trả về <code>{"{"}"error": "..."{"}"}</code>.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp10d { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp10d-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp10d svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp10d text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp10d .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp10d .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp10d .m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp10d .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp10d .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp10d .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp10d .own { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp10d .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp10d .bar { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp10d .limit { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp10d .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp10d .redline { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .gp10d .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gp10d .ln.dash { stroke-dasharray: 3 4; }
  .gp10d .ln.red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .gp10d .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp10d .hd.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .gp10d figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
